# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Copied into dist/ at build time and applied at the edge (not by
# `astro preview`). tests/test.spec.js reads this file, so a policy change here
# is checked in CI.
#
# Content-Security-Policy: strict where it matters (scripts), relaxed where
# the site is likely to change (images, styles, fonts).
#   - script-src   our own JS plus Cloudflare Web Analytics, which Cloudflare
#                  injects at the edge. Any new third-party script needs its
#                  origin added here.
#                  Known, accepted console error: Bot Fight Mode injects an
#                  inline script that this policy blocks. Allowing it would
#                  need 'unsafe-inline' or per-request nonces, so we accept it.
#   - connect-src  same origin plus cloudflareinsights.com (analytics beacon).
#   - form-action  the contact form posts to Formspree.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security: Cloudflare's dashboard HSTS setting (SSL/TLS ->
# Edge Certificates) overrides this value at the edge, so keep the two equal
# (currently six months). includeSubDomains covers every *.buckley.ca host.
# `preload` only advertises eligibility; the preload list needs max-age of at
# least one year.
#
# Deliberately absent: Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (would block the Cloudinary
# background) and Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy (would stop other sites
# embedding /og.png as a social card).
#
# Caching: HTML uses Cloudflare's default (revalidate every visit) so deploys
# go live at once. favicon.png and og.png keep their URLs when replaced, so
# they get one week rather than one year.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' https: data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https:; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; font-src 'self' https: data:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), browsing-topics=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15768000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none

/favicon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/og.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
